  "description": "Roar.DependencyInjection is a lightweight, convention-based dependency injection kernel for .NET. It provides automatic service registration, compile-time source generation, and design-time analysis to eliminate manual wiring. Use it to register services by role interfaces and leverage generated code for fast, AOT-safe startup. Perfect for class libraries, web apps, gRPC, and modular applications that want clean, maintainable composition without boilerplate.",
